      "category": "trade_procedure",
      "content": "Kenya import procedure via KRA customs and the Kenya Trade Information Portal.\n\nProcedure steps:\n1. Obtain KRA PIN: Register with Kenya Revenue Authority and obtain a PIN for import transactions.\n2. Get Import Declaration Form (IDF): Apply for IDF through Kenya TradeNet before shipment arrival.\n3. Customs clearance (iCMS): Clearing agent files entry in Integrated Customs Management System.\n4. Pay duties and release: Pay import duty, VAT, and levies; obtain release after inspection if required.\n\nSource: Kenya Trade Portal (https://kenyatradeportal.go.ke/)",
